{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5bcc0caf0d5eca21494fc0c23d9be461b2fe168099e5d5641a74a27fcfb1f940", "ja": "さてと、一区切りついたから、ちょっと休むか……。", "zh": "好了，既然工作告一段落了，稍微休息一下吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "d347049c21ccec69fd6c58e4f7e95ead74d6bc082afd9c0d4fe8b3b093588314", "ja": "あ、仕掛け人さま！\n仕掛け人さまも、休憩のお時間ですか？", "zh": "啊，策划执行人先生！\n策划执行人先生也要休息了是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2762f601245dcbb1f6f84af969732d7e8547ffd13aae51731275dc5785f3c8d4", "ja": "ああ。コーヒーでも淹れようと思って。\n……あれ、豆が切れてるな。俺のコーヒー……。", "zh": "嗯，我正打算泡杯咖啡。\n……咦？没有咖啡豆了。我的咖啡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "780f71b72378510b85cd805ac7389720464dd72282feac44a2a0aca4e99b9049", "ja": "でしたら、私が抹茶を淹れてさしあげます♪\nええと、確かここに……。", "zh": "这样的话，我泡抹茶给您喝吧♪\n我看看，记得是在这……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d3e7fe0bbf5009a658260394fb30b2e21cabe9c337d856411bd49770260e2ead", "ja": "ど、どうしたエミリー！", "zh": "怎、怎么了，艾蜜莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "f094f477b9476117832da8a3e0a653f42a4f940c83a5be37e68a3d749b8dc8df", "ja": "うぅ……すみません、仕掛け人さま……。私も、\n買い置きの抹茶を切らしてしまっていました……。", "zh": "呜呜……真不好意思，策划执行人先生……\n我多买的抹茶也用完了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "114432232a5d26abc9a346c5af318ee1ea1563e3da17995e0c4592befa465d42", "ja": "せっかく、おいしい抹茶の風味を\n楽しんでいただこうと思ったのに……。うぅ……。", "zh": "好不容易有机会，\n可以让您尝尝美味的抹茶……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "516e5a0e372b6e43fc75445a11940e08b9a6f6eb8553249f1907d1dfcff62076", "ja": "なるほど……。じゃあ、せっかくだから\n抹茶を一緒に買いに行こうか。", "zh": "这样啊……要不然，\n我们一起去买抹茶吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c302005d72476081e6e49da39d021e5de25f94f990a2c07cabc48ee3c1bff12", "ja": "え……。珈琲でなくていいのですか？", "zh": "咦……不买咖啡没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "282049a1b8414798a9195ad6d9d02912a6f760f0db4882bf0489538d493b47fd", "ja": "エミリーと話しているうちに、抹茶が飲みたくなって\nきたんだ。さすがは大和撫子だな！", "zh": "跟艾蜜莉聊着聊着就想喝抹茶了。\n真不愧是大和抚子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "2e2c60d612001cc7e23da409e6220ab600141de718ff15c3378fe87cded1f3b2", "ja": "そ、そんなっ。私なんてまだまだです。\n……でも……えへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "什、什么话，我还差得远啊。\n……不过……嘿嘿，谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0053_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "cacb59e2befc84f777a7d67653c456ac7c0c7d20a29dc523133e0f46a07ff998", "ja": "では、帰ってきたら精一杯、大和撫子らしいお抹茶を\n淹れさせていただきますね。さぁ、参りましょう♪", "zh": "那么，回来以后，我会像大和抚子那样，\n全心全意泡抹茶给您喝的。来，我们出发吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
